00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.200
I could actually
just tell it to use

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.720
whatever is in my environment.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.810
So in this case, what's
going on in RStudio.

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.670
So I can create the
