00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:10.030
as well. For R Markdown

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:12.550
we showed that you could
do thematic and bslib

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:14.890
for those items proper.

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:19.260
So here I have a theme component
inside in R Markdown doc.

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:21.430
So it's an HTML document.

