00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:55.170
In summary, you can
use bslib

00:21:55.170 --> 00:21:57.230
to theme Shiny and R Markdown.

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:59.870
This will upgrade to
bootstrap 4 by default.

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:02.580
If you're having apps breaking,
you can always downgrade

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:04.430
to version equals 3.

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:06.590
You can use bootswatch
or custom design

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.510
for your own custom themes.

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:11.030
You can use bootstrap
underscore theme preview

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:11.880
or bootstrap

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:14.780
underscore themer to
quickly preview and update

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:16.610
themes interactively.

00:22:16.610 --> 00:22:20.840
There's a full blown article
about theming with bslib

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:22.640
here that we'll
