00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:26.300
And you can use thematic for
easier theming of R plots

00:22:26.300 --> 00:22:27.870
in conjunction
with bootstrap lib.

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:31.370
So R Markdown, base R,
ggplot, lattice,

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:34.190
all these different
components can be perpetuated

00:22:34.190 --> 00:22:36.170
